The minimum bins map cleanly to existing internal signals: commit-side instruction fields, decoded LS/CSR/M-unit controls, branch redirect state, RAS/BP update wires, and stall/flush wires. I’m checking exact names through the rest of `core.v` before editing so the bind module doesn’t rely on guessed identifiers.
